%% ============================================
%% FRONTISPIECE — "全書一句話" spread built on the book's own thesis verse
%% (7:14), the same role Exodus 40:34-35, Job 42:5-6 and Acts 1:8 play in
%% the sister volumes.
%% ============================================
\thispagestyle{empty}
\begin{center}
\vspace*{0.3in}

\begin{tikzpicture}
  \draw[ScriptureGold, line width=0.8pt] (-2.8,0) -- (-0.55,0);
  \fill[ScriptureGold] (0,0) circle (0.055);
  \draw[ScriptureGold, line width=0.8pt] (0.55,0) -- (2.8,0);
\end{tikzpicture}

\vspace{0.22cm}
{\Large\bfseries\color{ChapterPurple} 全書一句話 \textperiodcentered\ The Whole Book in One Verse}

\vspace{0.30cm}
\fcolorbox{ScriptureGold}{ScriptureBg}{%
\begin{minipage}{4.6in}
\centering\vspace{0.2cm}
\normalsize\color{CommentaryBrown}
這稱為我名下的子民，若是\textbf{\color{GloryGold!80!black}自卑}、禱告、\textbf{\color{GloryGold!80!black}尋求}我的面，轉離他們的惡行，\\
我必從天上垂聽，赦免他們的罪，醫治他們的地。\\[0.5em]
\footnotesize\itshape
if My people who are called by My name humble themselves and pray and
\textbf{seek} My face and turn from their wicked ways, then I will hear
from heaven, will forgive their sin and will heal their land.\\[0.4em]
\small\color{ChapterPurple} 歷代志下 7:14 \textperiodcentered\ 2 Chronicles 7:14
\vspace{0.2cm}
\end{minipage}}

\vspace{0.35cm}
{\small\color{TextGray} 三十六章 \textperiodcentered\ 八卷 \textperiodcentered\ 二十一位王 \textperiodcentered\ 一條貫穿全書的線索\\
\textit{Thirty-six chapters \textperiodcentered\ eight volumes \textperiodcentered\ twenty-one kings \textperiodcentered\ one thread running through}}

\vspace{0.30cm}
{\small
\renewcommand{\arraystretch}{1.25}
\begin{tabular}{@{}p{2.8cm}p{2.2cm}p{7.1cm}@{}}
\toprule
\textbf{段落} & \textbf{章節} & \textbf{在全書的展開} \\
\midrule
所羅門時代 & 1-9章 & 求智慧、建聖殿、榮光充滿——巔峰 \\
王國分裂 & 10章 & 羅波安一句決定，統一的王國從此斷裂 \\
早期猶大王 & 11-20章 & 亞撒、約沙法尋求與倚靠的反覆拉鋸 \\
中期猶大王 & 21-28章 & 黑暗時期裏約阿施、約坦的幾道微光 \\
希西家復興 & 29-32章 & 潔淨聖殿、守逾越節、全面宗教改革 \\
瑪拿西轉折 & 33章 & 極惡之王在急難中悔改，神應允了他 \\
約西亞復興 & 34-35章 & 律法書出土，點燃最後一次大復興 \\
末代四王與尾聲 & 36章 & 聖殿被焚，古列的詔令重新打開門 \\
\bottomrule
\end{tabular}
}

\vspace{0.4cm}
\textcolor{ScriptureGold}{\rule{2.5in}{0.7pt}}
\vspace{0.3cm}

{\bfseries\color{ChapterPurple} 讀經之鑰 \textperiodcentered\ How to Read This Book}

\vspace{0.18cm}
\begin{minipage}{4.6in}
\small\color{TextGray}
不是來讀一部猶大列王的政治興衰史，是來看神如何持守祂與大衛所立的約，並向每一位願意回轉的王守信。\\
若你讀完三十六章卻只記得「誰打贏了仗、誰建了甚麼工程」——請從頭再讀，\\
這次留意：全書給每一位王打分數的量尺，只有一句話——他尋求耶和華了嗎？\\[0.5em]
\textit{\footnotesize
You are not reading a political history of the kings of Judah — you are
watching how God keeps His covenant with David, and remains faithful to
every king who is willing to turn back to Him.\\
If after thirty-six chapters you remember only who won which battle and
who built what, read it again.\\
This time notice the one question by which every king is measured: did he
seek the LORD?}
\end{minipage}

\vfill
{\scriptsize\color{LightGray} PubHub 三書精讀系統 \textperiodcentered\ Soli Deo Gloria}

